    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51404" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴττω</span></b> , 
			Boeot.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴστω</span>,
			3sg. imper. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶδα</span>, esp. in phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴττω
			Ζεύς</span> Zeus <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>be
				witness!</i> says Cebes the Theban in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				62a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θήβαθεν ἴττω Δεύς</span>,
			and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴττω Ἡρακλῆς</span>, says the
			Boeotian in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				911
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				860
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				345a
			</span></i>.</div>
